{"id":"zweimal","lemma":"zweimal","pos":"adv","rank":1285,"glosses":["twice"],"ipa":"/ˈt͡svaɪ̯maːl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e0/De-zweimal.ogg/De-zweimal.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich habe es zweimal überprüft.","en":"I checked it twice.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392445","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to check, to verify","l":"überprüfen"}]},{"text":"Ich war zweimal dort.","en":"I've been there twice.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"there, yonder"}]},{"text":"Er kommt zweimal pro Woche hierher.","en":"He comes here twice a week.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},null,{"g":"per, each"},{"g":"week"},{"g":"to here, here , hither"}]},{"text":"Sie besucht ihn zweimal im Jahr.","en":"She visits him twice a year.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to visit, to see","l":"besuchen"},{"g":"him"},null,{"g":"in the"},{"g":"year"}]},{"text":"Das musste ich nicht zweimal sagen.","en":"I didn't have to say it twice.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"to say (to pronounce"}]}]}